1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
这碗面，一滴汤都没有
Not a single drop of soup

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
武汉热干面，靠拌不靠泡
Wuhan hot-dry noodles — tossed, not soaked

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
碱水面，煮到八分就捞起
Alkaline noodles, pulled at eighty percent

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
掸凉、淋油，隔夜也不坨
Fanned cool, oiled — won't clump

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
灵魂是那一大勺芝麻酱
The soul: a big spoon of sesame paste

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
趁热拌开，每根都裹满
Toss while hot — every strand coated

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
老字号蔡林记，1928年就有
Cai Lin Ji, since 1928

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
2011年，列入湖北省级非遗
2011: Hubei provincial heritage

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
武汉人吃早餐，叫"过早"
Breakfast here has its own word: guo-zao

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
一碗拌面，就是清晨的烟火
A tossed bowl — the city waking up

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,400
汤派拌派你站哪？下集：闻着臭的那碗
Soup or toss? Next: the stinky bowl
